    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Diarrhoea is one of the leading causes of preventable mortality among children in Pakistan. Timely recognition of when to intervene is of the utmost importance in preventing deterioration. CIME and the Department of Paediatrics and Child Health joined hands with the Sanofi Pakistan to provide general practitioners with the relevant knowledge and skills to effectively manage childhood diarrhoeal illness in the community.",
